  "_note": "Provider registry shared by the triage slip, use_provider.py and the benchmark. models.<tier>.id is the real model behind each clinic; extra_body is sent with benchmark requests; pricing is optional (USD per million tokens). Fields listed in `unverified` could not be confirmed against the live official docs on 2026-09-28. `effort` is the Claude Code effort level written into the clinic agent; for third-party providers it is passed through to their Anthropic-compatible endpoint and whether they honour it is unverified (effort_verified=false). `api_effort` describes what the benchmark sends through extra_body.",
